    "title": "Wooodream Akiya popper",
    "descriptionHtml": "<p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A limited colour range for 2022 for the Japanese lure maker, Woodream.</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">A cup with small-diameter, slender and easy-to-use popper</p><p style=\"white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">With the concept of being easy to&nbsp;use and handle, the shape and swimming that have been constantly prototyped and tested.<br />It’s a popper that has the potential to respond to users intended&nbsp;action with less resistance for its size and strong&nbsp;bubble trail when worked.</p><ul data-rte-list=\"default\"><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Lenght 250 mm</p></li><li><p style=\"text-align: start; ; white-space:pre-wrap;\" data-rte-preserve-empty=\"true\">Gr. 130</p></li></ul>",
